  "about": "The stereoPair JSON of ImmersiveApi.open for flat 3D photos, version 1 (design-final 2026-10-26, section 4.1). The Dart tests write each request and compare it with this file; the Kotlin tests read it. A depthRelief request names its mode only for 2.5D (mesh25d); without it, or with a mode a reader does not know, the relief first shows in stereo. cacheKeys gives the text of each relief cache key and its SHA-256: the mode is not part of it, the map is the same. volumetricScene holds the request of a 3D scene of phase 2 (design-final 2026-10-27, section 8.5): the scene is the glb-layers-v1 tail of the file, sceneLength bytes long, checked by sceneSha256; flags may be empty. unknown holds requests a reader of version 1 refuses: the viewer then shows the photo flat.",
